OL,5,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,6,     FJools is joined by singer and
OL,7,     Fsongwriter Sam Brown, with music
OL,8,     Fby CPE Bach, Copland and Caroline
OL,9,     FShaw.
OL,10,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,11,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,12,     FMusic. 1741. On a rough crossing
OL,13,     Fto Dublin, Handel carries the
OL,14,     Fmanuscript of a masterpiece.
OL,15,G1400 Record Review
OL,16,     FAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,17,     Fthe week's new classical releases,
OL,18,     Fjoined by Kirsten Gibson who picks
OL,19,     Fher 5 favourite recordings by this
OL,20,     Fweek's Proms Composer, John
OL,21,     FDowland.
